<p>Hi <%= @user.name %>,</p>

<p>You've been invited to join <strong><%= @workspace.name %></strong> on Clar.</p>

<p>To get started, set your password using the link below:</p>

<p><%= link_to "Set Your Password", edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token) %></p>

<p>This link will expire in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>. After setting your password, you can sign in at <%= link_to "clar.rubyonsaas.com", root_url %>.</p>

<p>Welcome aboard!</p>
